: StageR 3 standard-library overlay for `std/math` (`stage_1_impls/std/math.sl3`).
ns std/math.

: Returns the smaller of two `u8` values.
: @dc l8589987674
pub v/u8/min u8/a u8/b
    test
        in u8:3 u8:7
        out u8:3.
        in u8:9 u8:2
        out u8:2.
    if le /a /b /a /b.

: Returns the smaller of two `i32` values.
: @dc l8589987675
pub v/i32/min i32/a i32/b
    test
        in i32:-5 i32:3
        out i32:-5.
        in i32:4 i32:4
        out i32:4.
    if le /a /b /a /b.

: Returns the smaller of two `u32` values.
: @dc l8589987676
pub v/u32/min u32/a u32/b
    test
        in u32:10 u32:4
        out u32:4.
    if le /a /b /a /b.

